For $\(0, q\)$-forms $u, v \in L _{\(0, q\)} ^{2} \(\Om\)$ with $u = \sum _{\alpha = 1} ^{N} \chi_{\alpha} u _{J} \bar{\omega} _{J}, v = \sum _{\alpha = 1} ^{N} \chi_{\alpha} v _{I} \bar{\omega} _{I}$, the $L^2$ inner product is defined as 
