We only point out the difference in the proof from the case of $\(0, n - 1\)$-forms, which is in the a priori estimates of $\lnm \({\rm I} - B_{q'-1}\) v_{\alpha, \varepsilon} ^{k} f \rnm$. Here, by applying (\ref{M-1 estimate2}),  we have
