\section{Our Proposed Model}
\blue{In this section, based on the literature reviewed above, we now introduce our proposed model, which combines an MLP-Mixer-based distillation approach with a reservoir-based classifier designed for energy-efficient HAR.} We first present an inference mechanism using ESNs, and then discuss how to train such an inference mechanism of ESNs. In the second half, we use the distillation mechanism for training purposes.\\

