\subsubsection{Implementation Tools}

The prototype system was implemented with Unity 3D and the OpenAI API. The graphical user interface was developed using Unity 3D (Unity 2021.3.12). For speech-to-text conversion, we utilized OpenAI’s Whisper (\texttt{Whisper}), and text-to-speech conversion was handled by the OpenAI TTS model (\texttt{tts-1}). All tasks requiring the use of an LLM were performed using the \texttt{gpt-4o-0806} model. This model was selected for its ability to handle complex reasoning and maintain consistent responses during multi-round interactions, which aligned with our needs for personality simulation in the agent implementation. In personality assessment tasks, we set the temperature to 0 to prioritize reliable output over innovation and ensure reproducibility of our results.





\subsection{Implementation of LLM Agents}

The LLM Agents were implemented from two aspects: Role-Playing and Cognition.


