\date{}

\begin{abstract}
  A new Goodman-Sharma type modification of the Meyer-K\"{o}nig and Zeller operator for
  approximation of bounded continuous functions on $[0,\,1)$ is presented. We estimate the
  approximation error of the proposed operator and prove direct and strong converse theorems with
  respect to a related K-functional. The operator is linear but not a positive one. However it
  benefits a better order of approximation compared to the Goodman-Sharma variant of
  Meyer-K\"{o}nig and Zeller type operator investigated by Ivanov and Parvanov \cite{IvPa2012}.
\end{abstract}

