In this section, we present the optimal slice images and histograms for the RBE-weighted fractional dose $d_{RBE,fx}$, the dose-averaged linear energy transfer $l_{d}$ and the probability of lesion origin $p$, as well as their interplay.

\subsubsection{\texorpdfstring{RBE-weighted fractional dose $d_{RBE,fx}$}{RBE-weighted fractional dose dRBEfx}}
\Cref{fig:optimal-dose} shows the slice images with the optimal dose distributions, where the POLO model-based objective functions are displayed vertically and the NTCP levels horizontally.
