\centerline{\includegraphics[width=0.3\textwidth, height=0.34\textheight]{fig3.png}}
\caption{The architecture of Low-frequency Context Fusion Block(LCFB). PE, PR, LN represent Patch Embedding, Patch Recovery, LayerNorm, respectively.}
