                In addition, straight dashed lines with slopes corresponding to the maximum gradients $v\subt{max}^\tau$ 
                of the bands are superimposed. These are marked for bands $\tau\leq2$ with black-dashed lines 
                and for bands $\tau>2$ with white-dashed lines.
