\subsection{Implementation}
Our code extends the official PyTorch \texttt{Difflogic} library by Felix Petersen, i.e., the reference implementation provided alongside the Differentiable LGN paper \citep{NEURIPS2022_0d3496dd}. During the forward pass we replace the standard \verb|torch.nn.functional.softmax | with a hard Gumbel-Softmax, \verb|torch.nn.functional.gumbel_softmax |, thereby enabling discrete sampling while maintaining end-to-end differentiability.

