    \caption{Distributions of regression parameters between forecastability $\mathtt{F}$ and $\mathtt{nRMSE}$ at each station: $\mathtt{R}^2$, $\mathtt{slope}$, and $\mathtt{intercept}$, aggregated by forecasting model.}
